# Tests

Run unit tests directly:

```sh
dotnet test src/Tests/Unit/{{API_NAME}}.Tests.Unit.csproj
```

Run black-box tests against disposable containers:

```sh
make build-db
./build/test-black-box.sh
```

Run these commands from the repository root. The runner requires the existing database `:test` image built by `make build-db` and preserves it after testing. Rebuild it when database image inputs change. Set `DATABASE_IMAGE_NAME` consistently for both commands to override the database image repository.
